OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,7,Fmorning, which may be heavy. Showers
OL,8,Fwill gradually ease through the
OL,9,Fafternoon and evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMost places will be dry with
OL,12,Fclear spells this evening and
OL,13,Fovernight, although a few light
OL,14,Fshowers remain possible at first.
OL,15,FTurning rather cold with light winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,18,Frisk of frost. Then remaining dry and
OL,19,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,20,Fsunshine and just patches of cloud
OL,21,Facross Argyll.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
