OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,6,Fsettled on Sunday with sunshine.
OL,7,FPartly cloudy on Monday with some
OL,8,Fsunny spells, before turning more
OL,9,Fwidely cloudy on Tuesday with the risk
OL,10,Fof patchy rain.
